WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:02.642
First Normal Form removes repeating groups and

00:00:02.668 --> 00:00:05.155
requires each field to represent one value

00:00:06.899 --> 00:00:09.030
Instead of storing several service codes in

00:00:09.043 --> 00:00:11.820
one cell each appointment-service occurrence gets
its

00:00:11.846 --> 00:00:15.809
own row That immediately makes each service

00:00:15.835 --> 00:00:18.322
easier to filter validate and connect to

00:00:18.335 --> 00:00:22.811
other tables But 1NF does not solve

00:00:22.824 --> 00:00:27.082
every design problem In the example patient

00:00:27.108 --> 00:00:31.121
information provider information appointment
information and service

00:00:31.148 --> 00:00:33.832
information are still repeated across several rows

00:00:35.670 --> 00:00:38.038
So think of 1NF as the beginning

00:00:38.064 --> 00:00:41.435
of the normalization process We have removed

00:00:41.462 --> 00:00:43.633
lists inside fields but we still need

00:00:43.646 --> 00:00:45.488
to ask which columns depend on which

00:00:45.514 --> 00:00:46.449
parts of the key
